  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research on Growth and Urbanisation in Low Income Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To produce improved research evidence on urbanisation, to interpret it and to communicate it to policy-makers, so that policies in urban areas of developing countries are more helpful for poverty reduction and economic growth. By 2018 there will be at least ten instances of urban policies in developing countries being influenced by the project&#x2019;s evidence and interpretation.</narrative>
  </description>
